##OpenGL GLIB
Perspective 70.
LookAt 0 0 3  0 0 0  0 1 0

Vertex		pattern.vert
Fragment	pattern.frag
Program		sample					                    \
		        uA <0. .2 1.>				            \
		        uP <.1 1. 4.>				            \
                uKa <0. 0.1 1.0>                        \
                uKd <0. 0.6 1.0>                        \
                uKs <0. 0.3 1.0>                        \
                uShininess <1. 10. 100.>                \
                uLightX <-20. 5. 20.>                   \
                uLightY <-20. 10. 20.>                  \
                uLightZ <-20. 20. 20.> 

QuadXY  0.  1.  128  128

